{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>亞太經濟合作組織APEC財長會在灣仔會展舉行。行政長官李家超表示，香港首度承辦會議意義重大，而會場外保安明顯加強。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201725-APEC%E8%B2%A1%E9%95%B7%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0%E7%89%B9%E9%A6%96%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%A6%96%E5%BA%A6%E6%89%BF%E8%BE%A6%E6%84%8F%E7%BE%A9%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%A7%E5%A0%B4%E5%A4%96%E4%BF%9D%E5%AE%89%E6%98%8E%E9%A1%AF%E5%8A%A0%E5%BC%B7\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>APEC財長會議｜特首︰香港首度承辦意義重大　場外保安明顯加強</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201729-APEC%E8%B2%A1%E9%95%B7%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0%E8%A8%B1%E6%AD%A3%E5%AE%87%E5%87%BA%E5%B8%AD%E7%9B%B8%E9%97%9C%E7%A0%94%E8%A8%8E%E6%9C%83%E6%8C%87%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E7%B6%93%E6%BF%9F%E8%BD%89%E5%9E%8B%E9%A0%88%E5%90%88%E4%BD%9C%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>APEC財長會議｜許正宇出席相關研討會　指全球經濟轉型須合作創新</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201748-APEC%E8%B2%A1%E9%95%B7%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0%E8%B6%B3%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%8D%E6%BA%AB%E8%B2%A1%E6%94%BF%E9%83%A8%E9%83%A8%E9%95%B7%E8%97%8D%E4%BD%9B%E5%AE%89%E8%87%B4%E9%96%8B%E5%B9%95%E8%BE%AD\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>APEC財長會議‧足本重溫｜財政部部長藍佛安致開幕辭</strong></a></p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201749-APEC%E8%B2%A1%E9%95%B7%E6%9C%83%E8%AD%B0%E8%B6%B3%E6%9C%AC%E9%87%8D%E6%BA%AB%E9%AB%98%E5%AE%98%E6%9C%83%E4%B8%BB%E5%B8%AD%E9%99%B3%E6%97%AD%E9%80%9A%E5%A0%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%9C%8B%E5%B9%B4%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E9%80%B2%E5%B1%95%E5%92%8C%E6%88%90%E6%9E%9C\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>APEC財長會議‧足本重溫｜高官會主席陳旭通報中國年工作進展和成果</strong></a></p><p></p><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。第19日審訊，由蔡天鳳前私人司機錢紀信作供。他透露車上的行車紀錄儀線路曾斷開，由鄺港傑重新駁回後只有他可存取錄影。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1201728-%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E7%A2%8E%E5%B1%8D%E6%A1%88%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3%E5%89%8D%E7%A7%81%E4%BA%BA%E5%8F%B8%E6%A9%9F%E8%BB%8A%E4%B8%8A%E8%A1%8C%E8%BB%8A%E7%B4%80%E9%8C%84%E5%84%80%E7%B7%9A%E8%B7%AF%E6%9B%BE%E6%96%B7%E9%96%8B\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>蔡天鳳碎屍案｜蔡天鳳前私人司機︰車上行車紀錄儀線路曾斷開</strong></a></p><p></p><p>(旁述由AI生成)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:04.389959+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":304,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T10:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:55.101854+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:55.101854+00:00","content_hash":"6c7e358e777c35e902f9a3d998d610282055369bb383bd32dfbebc3b7295ee59","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}